stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Ticket Created (Customer Service)
    
    Pending --> Assigned: Assigned to Technician
    Assigned --> InProgress: Technician Starts Task (Mobile App)
    Assigned --> Pending: Reassigned / Unassigned
    
    InProgress --> Completed: Task Finished + Serial Verified
    InProgress --> Cancelled: Customer Cancelled / Invalid Issue
    
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]